{"schemaVersion":1,"shard":210,"count":22,"items":[{"key":"[\"B1L02-1-29\",\"分\",\"分\",\"分\",\"M\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我八點十分去學校。","pinyin":"Wǒ bā diǎn shí fēn qù xuéxiào.","english":"I go to school at 8:10.","sourceCardId":"B1L02-1-29","sourceFront":"分","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"A：現在幾點？ B：現在十點二十五分。","pinyin":"A: Xiànzài jǐ diǎn? B: Xiànzài shí diǎn èrshíwǔ fēn.","english":"A: What time is it now? B: It’s 10:25.","sourceCardId":"B1L02-1-30","sourceFront":"幾點","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"我四點四十分下課。","pinyin":"Wǒ sì diǎn sìshí fēn xiàkè.","english":"I get out of class at 4:40.","sourceCardId":"B1L02-1-01","sourceFront":"幾","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"這個學期開始，從星期一到星期五我都有華語課，每天從上午八點四十分到中午十二點上課，下午一點寫功課，有時候也跟同學練習說中文。","pinyin":"Zhè ge xuéqí kāishǐ, cóng xīngqí yī dào xīngqí wǔ, wǒ dōu yǒu Huáyǔ kè, měi tiān cóng shàngwǔ bā diǎn sìshí fēn dào zhōngwǔ shí’èr diǎn shàngkè, xiàwǔ yī diǎn xiě gōngkè, yǒushíhou yě gēn tóngxué liànxí shuō Zhōngwén.","english":"This semester I have Chinese class from 8:40 a.m. to 12:00 noon, Mondays to Fridays. I start to do my homework at 1:00 p.m., and sometimes I practice speaking Chinese with my classmates.","sourceCardId":"B1L09-3-01","sourceFront":"學期","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"An 八(eight) slices fall all around from one 刀(knife) → each piece is a 分(minute)."},{"key":"[\"B1L03-1-08\",\"两\",\"兩\",\"两\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我想買兩本中文書、一本英文書。","pinyin":"Wǒ xiǎng mǎi liǎng běn Zhōngwén shū, yì běn Yīngwén shū.","english":"I want to buy two books in Chinese and a book in English.","sourceCardId":"B1L03-1-10","sourceFront":"中文","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"友美愛看書，我想送她兩本中文書，你呢？","pinyin":"Yǒuměi ài kànshū, wǒ xiǎng sòng tā liǎng běn Zhōngwén shū, nǐ ne?","english":"Youmei loves reading. I would like to give her two books in Chinese as a gift. How about you?","sourceCardId":"B1L03-1-01","sourceFront":"買","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"我有兩枝鉛筆。","pinyin":"Wǒ yǒu liǎng zhī qiānbǐ.","english":"I have two pencils.","sourceCardId":"B1L03-2-08","sourceFront":"枝","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":3},{"chinese":"我們買兩枝，好不好？兩枝五十塊錢。","pinyin":"Wǒmen mǎi liǎng zhī, hǎo bù hǎo? Liǎng zhī wǔshí kuài qián.","english":"How about we buy two of them? Two for 50NT dollars.","sourceCardId":"B1L03-2-01","sourceFront":"這","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":3},{"chinese":"我有一位英國老師和兩位日本老師。","pinyin":"Wǒ yǒu yí wèi Yīngguó lǎoshī hé liǎng wèi Rìběn lǎoshī.","english":"I have one British teacher and two Japanese teachers.","sourceCardId":"B1L04-2-09","sourceFront":"位","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這些東西一共兩萬三千五百零五塊。","pinyin":"Zhèxiē dōngxi yígòng liǎng wàn sān qiān wǔ bǎi líng wǔ kuài.","english":"These stuff cost twenty three thousand, five hundred and five dollars in total.","sourceCardId":"B1L04-2-20","sourceFront":"零","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我媽媽有一個哥哥跟兩個妹妹。","pinyin":"Wǒ māma yǒu yí ge gēge gēn liǎng ge mèimei.","english":"My mom has an elder brother and two younger sisters.","sourceCardId":"B1L05-2-18","sourceFront":"妹妹","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"客廳裡面有兩張沙發。","pinyin":"Kètīng lǐmiàn yǒu liǎng zhāng shāfā.","english":"There are two sofas in the living room.","sourceCardId":"B1L05-2-19","sourceFront":"沙發","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我家有一隻貓、兩隻狗和三隻鳥。","pinyin":"Wǒ jiā yǒu yì zhī māo, liǎng zhī gǒu hé sān zhī niǎo.","english":"I have a cat, two dogs, and three birds in my house.","sourceCardId":"B1L05-3-10","sourceFront":"隻","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小姐，我們要點兩碗牛肉麵和兩杯茶。","pinyin":"Xiǎojiě, wǒmen yào diǎn liǎng wǎn niúròu miàn hé liǎng bēi chá.","english":"Miss, we would like to order two bowls of beef noodles and two cups of tea.","sourceCardId":"B1L04-2-01","sourceFront":"點","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"請問兩位要紅茶還是綠茶？","pinyin":"Qǐngwèn liǎng wèi yào hóngchá háishì lǜchá?","english":"Would you like to have black tea or green tea?","sourceCardId":"B1L04-2-01","sourceFront":"點","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"一共兩百一十五塊錢。","pinyin":"Yígòng liǎng bǎi yīshíwǔ kuài qián.","english":"It will be 215 dollars in total.","sourceCardId":"B1L04-2-01","sourceFront":"點","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"一共兩百多塊錢，好便宜！","pinyin":"Yígòng liǎng bǎi duō kuài qián, hǎo piányi!","english":"It is only a little over 200. It is cheap!","sourceCardId":"B1L04-2-01","sourceFront":"點","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我們這個星期六下午兩點半去吧。","pinyin":"Wǒmen zhè ge xīngqí liù xiàwǔ liǎng diǎn bàn qù ba.","english":"Let’s go this Saturday at 2:30 p.m.","sourceCardId":"B1L05-1-01","sourceFront":"錢包","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這兩天天氣有點兒冷，我們週末去，好嗎？","pinyin":"Zhè liǎng tiān tiānqì yǒudiǎnr lěng, wǒmen zhōumò qù, hǎo ma?","english":"It is a bit cold those two days. How about we do it this weekend?","sourceCardId":"B1L06-2-01","sourceFront":"電影","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這兩條我都去穿穿看。","pinyin":"Zhè liǎng tiáo wǒ dōu qù chuānchuān kàn.","english":"I will try both on.","sourceCardId":"B1L08-2-01","sourceFront":"黃色","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B1L16-1-18\",\"报纸\",\"報紙\",\"报纸\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"爸爸每天早上一起床就看報紙。","pinyin":"Bàba měitiān zǎoshang yì qǐchuáng jiù kàn bàozhǐ.","english":"Every morning as soon as Dad gets out of bed, he reads the newspaper.","sourceCardId":"B1L16-1-18","sourceFront":"報紙","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"林伯伯透過網路、報紙，尋找三十年前因為戰爭而分開的家人，最後終於找到了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-2-31","sourceFront":"尋找","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L02-1-29\",\"念\",\"念/唸\",\"念\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"昨天老師教的日本歷史，你念了嗎？這個字我沒學過，怎麼唸？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L02-1-29","sourceFront":"念","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"念了一個小時的書以後，你最好休息十分鐘。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L02-1-28","sourceFront":"念書","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"我買了幾張當地的明信片，這些是這次旅行很好的紀念。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L08-1-37","sourceFront":"紀念","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這本中文書，我念到第四十三頁了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L09-1-04","sourceFront":"頁","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"你得多念一點兒書，將來才有能力當教授。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L09-1-30","sourceFront":"能力","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"你得多念一點兒書，將來才有能力當教授。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L09-1-31","sourceFront":"將來","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"畢業後要工作還是要繼續念書，我得好好地想想再選擇！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L11-1-07","sourceFront":"選擇","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我的父母覺得出國念書才會有美好的未來。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L11-2-22","sourceFront":"未來","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"王教授推薦我去念那個研究所的翻譯課程。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L12-1-05","sourceFront":"課程","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"快考試了，這本書的前幾課我已經複習完了，可是沒時間念後三課。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L13-2-04","sourceFront":"前","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"快考試了，這本書的前幾課我已經複習完了，可是沒時間念後三課。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L13-2-05","sourceFront":"後","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"每個國家都有偉大的人物，值得大家紀念他們。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L15-2-02","sourceFront":"偉大","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"每個國家都有偉大的人物，值得大家紀念他們。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L15-2-04","sourceFront":"紀念","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"「教師節」這個節日是為了紀念偉大的孔子。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L15-2-05","sourceFront":"節日","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小韓早晚都打工，是因為想多存一些錢，早一點完成出國念書的夢想。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L02-1-09","sourceFront":"早晚","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"經過跟父母的討論，大中決定先出國遊學一年，再回來念大學。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L02-2-14","sourceFront":"經過","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這個紀念堂是為了紀念那些為國家犧牲生命的軍人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-2-04","sourceFront":"為","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"姊姊：下個星期就要大學考試了，你怎麼不用功念書，反而天天出去玩？ 弟弟：妳別管我，這是我自己的事。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-1-14","sourceFront":"管","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"章先生念國小時，父親帶著他上山下海、到處旅遊，那是屬於他們的美好記憶。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-2-13","sourceFront":"記憶","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我的法國朋友最初只計畫來臺灣學中文，沒想到後來拿到了獎學金，還念了博士班。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-2-24","sourceFront":"最初","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"對華人來說，把書念好才有美好的未來，這個傳統觀念在臺灣已經慢慢改變了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-1-14","sourceFront":"觀念","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在古代中國，男人不應該進廚房的傳統觀念，也因為時代的改變而不同。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-2-01","sourceFront":"時代","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小文房內的櫃子裡擺了很多寶貝，都是他上山下海帶回來的紀念品。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-1-16","sourceFront":"寶貝","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"快時尚的概念，就是在短時間內提供各式各樣的流行商品，讓顧客有更多更好的選擇。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-1-21","sourceFront":"概念","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"到新公司報到以前，應先把個人的態度及觀念調整好。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-1-04","sourceFront":"報到","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這幾箱書都是我念過的課本跟參考資料，打算送給育幼院的孩子。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-1-41","sourceFront":"箱","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"以前我的小學老師總是親切地教導我們，讓我到現在還是很懷念她。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-1-08","sourceFront":"懷念","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他的中文能力已達到相當好的水準，在臺灣念研究所沒問題。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-2-19","sourceFront":"達到","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"按照中國的傳統觀念，女人未嫁時得聽父親的話，嫁了人之後就得聽丈夫的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-1-43","sourceFront":"丈夫","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"幸福的婚姻不僅需要觀念的溝通，更需要感情的交流。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-1-45","sourceFront":"婚姻","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"紀念郵票一般都是以歷史上的大事或重要人物當作主題。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-1-42","sourceFront":"郵票","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這次畢業典禮，學校打算採用空拍的方式來拍紀念影片。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-2-03","sourceFront":"空拍","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這個字不好念，我重複了好幾次，同學都說不對，害我好想放棄。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-1-36","sourceFront":"重複","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他想等中文程度達到高級以後，就來臺灣念大學。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-1-01","sourceFront":"高級","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"從過去到現在，尊敬長輩一直是華人最重視的傳統觀念之一。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-1-39","sourceFront":"傳統","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在觀光景點銷售紀念品，價格通常比一般商店高一些。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-1-16","sourceFront":"紀念品","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"難得出國旅行，一定要多照幾張相片留念。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-1-18","sourceFront":"留念","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這座圓形廣場是為了紀念自由而建的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-12","sourceFront":"圓形","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"A 今(now) over a 心(heart) means your thoughts stay in the present → 念(think of)."},{"key":"[\"B2L04-2-25\",\"比如說\",\"比如（說）\",\"比如（说）\",\"Prep\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"他會說很多語言，比如說：英文、法文、德文。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L04-2-25","sourceFront":"比如說","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"住在學校宿舍有一些限制，比如說晚上十點前必須回到宿舍。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-1-22","sourceFront":"限制","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這個我覺得最難忘的回憶應該是跟「第一次」相關的經驗，比如第一次戀愛、第一次當背包客等等。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-1-15","sourceFront":"難忘","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"每個人心中都有理想的交友條件，比如年齡幾歲以下，身高幾公分以上，但我只要對方愛我就好了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-1-17","sourceFront":"以上","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null}